\f0\b \cf0 Limitations:
\f1\b0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The paper does not adequately address the main limitations. It should add a limitations section that explicitly restricts the scope of inference, reports the full generation protocol, discusses the risks of interpreting hallucinated text as evidence about real groups, and describes how stigmatizing gender-related content is handled.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

